−8 of −3: welk getal is groter?

00:00:06.625 --> 00:00:08.644 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Acht is toch meer dan drie?

00:00:08.674 --> 00:00:11.211 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
Bij positieve telgetallen klopt dat.

00:00:11.241 --> 00:00:14.471 line:74% position:50% align:middle size:88%
